# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The former subdomains (blog., edu., neck., tierparks., codenight.) are gone
# and their DNS records are deleted, so nothing resolves there to redirect
# from. Everything below is a same-origin move.

# ── Route segments went English (2026-09) ────────────────────────────────
# /education/ was named after the topic rather than the audience, which made
# it inconsistent with /companies/ and /individuals/.
